# Model Gateway

**First provider: LiteRouter** — always implement LiteRouter before others.

## LiteRouter API

- Base URL: `https://api.literouter.com/v1`
- Endpoint: `POST /v1/chat/completions`
- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <LITEROUTER_API_KEY>`
- Format: OpenAI-compatible (SSE streaming)
- Default model: `deepseek:free`
- Free models: `deepseek:free`, `mistral:free`, `llama:free`

## Env vars

```env
MODEL_PROVIDER=literouter
LITEROUTER_API_KEY=
LITEROUTER_BASE_URL=https://api.literouter.com/v1
LITEROUTER_MODEL=deepseek:free
```

## Docs

`docs/providers/literouter.md`

## Adding a new provider later

1. Add variant to `ProviderKind`
2. Create `src/providers/<name>.rs`
3. Register in `ModelGateway::from_config`
4. Document in `docs/providers/`
